{"id":"steam-988530","steam":988530,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Outrevenge","summary":"Top-Down Cyberpunk Action-Adventure! \r\n\r\n• Inspired by classic 80's and 90's games and action films • Intelligent enemies that adapt to your tactics.","about":"\"Top-Down Cyberpunk Action-Adventure\"\n\r\n\r\nA High-Octane Fusion of Boomer Shooter and Top-Down Combat Action!\r\n\r\nGet ready for adrenaline-pumping action inspired by classic 80's and 90's games and action films.\r\nLead a Military Special Missions Unit in a battle against deadly lifeforms.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\n\"A Forbidden World, Where Man Does Not Belong!\"\n\r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in a gripping top-down shooter that combines thrilling sci-fi firefights in bug infested hellscapes all the way to intense raw, jungle warfare.\r\n\r\nThe powerful mega-corporation operating on the giant space station Erena has resurrected life on the distant planet Zitatron-3. Erena is home to two distinct classes of humans: the privileged Citizens, who enjoy their lives in luxury, and the Workers, who live in grueling, prison-like conditions. These Workers dream of earning enough credits to elevate their families to citizenship and a better life.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\nKey Features:\n\r\n\r\n• Intense Combat: Engage in heart-pounding, fast-paced battles against swarms of alien creatures and hostile forces. Utilize a wide array of weapons and tactics to survive and dominate.\r\n\r\n• Rich Narrative: Unravel the story of a divided society on the brink of upheaval. Explore the harsh realities of life as a Worker and the opulence of Citizen life, and discover the dark secrets behind the corporation's resurrection of Zitatron-3.\r\n\r\n• Special game modes: Explore procedurally generated levels with your crew, or see how long you can survive the endless onslaught of alien insect hordes.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/library_600x900.jpg?t=1784892721","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/header.jpg?t=1784892721","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/library_hero.jpg?t=1784892721","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/header.jpg?t=1784892721","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1784892721","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/ss_0e8d2c870711f568612c5363f9e11b5f46343ef4.600x338.jpg?t=1784892721","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/ss_0e8d2c870711f568612c5363f9e11b5f46343ef4.jpg?t=1784892721"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/ss_052fb3118a3c4066d7e74399d96e0b5d2d3e2898.600x338.jpg?t=1784892721","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/ss_052fb3118a3c4066d7e74399d96e0b5d2d3e2898.jpg?t=1784892721"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/ss_4fa1ddfbcb9e4a2e4d97543be22152ab0c4336bc.600x338.jpg?t=1784892721","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/ss_4fa1ddfbcb9e4a2e4d97543be22152ab0c4336bc.jpg?t=1784892721"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/ss_c1b3d3fb107e01b2c156747355f2c1b313bfdebf.600x338.jpg?t=1784892721","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/ss_c1b3d3fb107e01b2c156747355f2c1b313bfdebf.jpg?t=1784892721"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/ss_978bcaaa90357ebaae6c2ef5466cd3b5f3f1363d.600x338.jpg?t=1784892721","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/ss_978bcaaa90357ebaae6c2ef5466cd3b5f3f1363d.jpg?t=1784892721"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it